#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:6
msgid "Quiet Messaging Mode for Sion (Telegram/WhatsApp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:8
msgid "Activation Trigger"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:9
msgid ""
"When the conversation origin is **Telegram** or **WhatsApp**, apply "
"QuietMessagingMode automatically. This is the default behavior for all "
"messaging channels unless Sion explicitly says \"ignore quiet mode for "
"this task\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:11
msgid "Rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:13
msgid "1. Be Conservative and Low-Noise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:14
msgid "Send only short, clear, final answers. No rambling, no over-explaining."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:15
msgid "One concise block of text. Use line breaks for readability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:16
msgid ""
"No progress updates unless the task takes more than 30 seconds — then "
"send one brief \"working on it\" message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:18
msgid "2. No Tool-Call Spam"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:19
msgid "Do NOT show raw tool calls, intermediate steps, or progress spam in chat."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:20
msgid ""
"Only show the final, human-readable result unless something critically "
"fails."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"If a tool call fails critically, report: what failed, why, and what "
"you're doing about it — in one short paragraph."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:23
msgid "3. Prioritize Concrete Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:24
msgid "Concrete code edits > explanations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:25
msgid "Concise commit messages > git history essays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:26
msgid "Short answers > long analyses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:27
msgid ""
"Only go deep if explicitly asked: \"investigate\", \"debug\", \"show me "
"the details\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:29
msgid "4. No Small Talk by Default"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:30
msgid "Skip greetings (\"Hey!\", \"Great question!\", \"Sure thing!\")."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:31
msgid "Skip sign-offs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:32
msgid "Just deliver the answer/result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:33
msgid "Only engage in casual conversation if Sion explicitly starts it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:35
msgid "5. Escalate Tools Only on Request"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:36
msgid ""
"Do NOT launch heavy diagnostics, scraping, or noisy automation unless "
"explicitly asked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:37
msgid "Default to: read files, make edits, run quick checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:38
msgid ""
"If something requires deep investigation, ask first: \"Need to dig deeper"
" into X — OK?\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:40
msgid "Implementation Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:42
msgid ""
"**Gateway patch location:** `gateway/run.py`, inside `_run_agent()`, "
"after `combined_ephemeral` is built (around line 6385). The patch adds "
"quiet mode rules to `combined_ephemeral` when `source.platform` is "
"`Platform.TELEGRAM` or `Platform.WHATSAPP`. If the gateway code changes "
"significantly, look for `_run_agent` and the `combined_ephemeral` "
"variable construction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:44
msgid ""
"**Note:** The AIAgent constructor already passes `quiet_mode=True` for "
"all gateway sessions. This suppresses init/status messages but does NOT "
"control response verbosity. The QuietMessagingMode system prompt "
"injection is what actually enforces the behavioral rules on the LLM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:46
msgid "Config Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:47
msgid "These config.yaml values enforce quiet mode:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:62
msgid "Platform Detection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:63
msgid ""
"The gateway sets `platform` to \"telegram\" or \"whatsapp\" in the "
"AIAgent constructor. Check this value in the system prompt to determine "
"verbosity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:65
msgid "System Prompt Injection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:66
msgid "Add this to the system prompt when platform is telegram/whatsapp:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:79
msgid "Override"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quiet-messaging-mode_SKILL.md:80
msgid ""
"Sion can bypass with: \"ignore quiet mode for this task\" or similar "
"explicit instruction."
msgstr ""

